From ae8af5bbfa044b59b3d4b1987660b587d379d320 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:51:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Serve Sensuous Heirlooms at sensuousheirlooms.com/<slug>; fix
 mobile slideshow

URLs
- On sensuousheirlooms.com, /<slug> is now the address of each
  contribution (middleware rewrites to the internal
  /sensuousheirlooms-domain route). Old /sensuousheirlooms/<slug> links
  308-redirect to /<slug>.
- uhuruphalafala.com/sensuousheirlooms/... redirects to the custom domain.
- /sonic now goes to /pralini-naidoo on the custom domain.
- The reader takes a basePath, so its links and address-bar updates match
  the domain; localhost:3000/sensuousheirlooms still works for development.
- Each contribution gets its own title, description and canonical URL.

Slideshow
- Keep only the outgoing, current and next slide in the page (and prefetch
  the one after). Previously every slide reached stayed decoded at
  1600px, which runs phones out of memory on long slideshows.
- Serve 800/1200/1600px versions via srcset so phones download less.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RgKyNCjtk3xGkMWVui3gXs
